---
source: crates/mercury-schema/tests/snapshots.rs
expression: "json!({ \"input\": input, \"output\": output })"
---
{
  "input": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "since": {
        "format": "date",
        "type": [
          "string",
          "null"
        ]
      }
    },
    "title": "BlockedArgs",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "output": {
    "$defs": {
      "DisplayName": {
        "format": "display-name",
        "maxLength": 60,
        "minLength": 1,
        "pattern": "^(?:[\\p{L}'’-]+ )*[\\p{L}'’-]*\\p{L}[\\p{L}'’-]*(?: [\\p{L}'’-]+)*$",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "Evidence": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "What a fact rests on. Deserializing rejects a state that doesn't fit the type, and a `ref` on\nCI runs or releases.",
        "properties": {
          "at": {
            "format": "date",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ref": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/IssueNumber"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "`#<number>` for pull requests and issues when the policy shows references, else `null`."
          },
          "state": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/EvidenceState"
          },
          "type": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/EvidenceType"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "type",
          "ref",
          "state",
          "at"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "EvidenceState": {
        "description": "The states of every evidence type in one list; [`Evidence`] checks that the pair fits.",
        "enum": [
          "open",
          "draft",
          "merged",
          "closed",
          "passed",
          "failed",
          "running",
          "published"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "EvidenceType": {
        "enum": [
          "pr",
          "issue",
          "ci",
          "release"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "Fact": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "One structured statement about a piece of work.",
        "properties": {
          "confidence": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Ratio"
          },
          "evidence": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/Evidence"
            },
            "type": "array"
          },
          "id": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/FactId"
          },
          "kind": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Kind"
          },
          "module": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ModuleName"
          },
          "people": {
            "description": "Only when the effective policy shows people; otherwise empty.",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/DisplayName"
            },
            "type": "array"
          },
          "status": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Status"
          },
          "tested": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Tested"
          },
          "title": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/SafeText"
          },
          "title_withheld": {
            "description": "`true` when the title failed a rule or a check and was replaced.",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "waiting_on": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/WaitingOn"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "kind",
          "title",
          "module",
          "status",
          "tested",
          "confidence",
          "waiting_on",
          "people",
          "evidence",
          "title_withheld",
          "updated_at"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "FactId": {
        "format": "fact-id",
        "pattern": "^f_[A-Za-z0-9]{4,16}$",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "IssueNumber": {
        "format": "issue-number",
        "pattern": "^#[1-9][0-9]{0,8}$",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "Kind": {
        "enum": [
          "feature",
          "fix",
          "chore",
          "unknown"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "ModuleName": {
        "description": "A module name from the probe's describe tool, or Other.",
        "format": "module-name",
        "pattern": "^\\p{L}[\\p{L}\\p{N} &+-]{0,39}$",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "Ratio": {
        "maximum": 1,
        "minimum": 0,
        "type": "number"
      },
      "SafeText": {
        "description": "One line of redacted text: no code, paths, identifiers, URLs, e-mail addresses or secrets.",
        "format": "safe-text",
        "maxLength": 120,
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "SchemaId": {
        "const": "mercury.facts/0.1",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "Status": {
        "enum": [
          "done",
          "in_review",
          "in_progress",
          "blocked",
          "not_started",
          "unclear"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "Tested": {
        "description": "`missing` only where the probe counts tests, never in `metadata` mode.",
        "enum": [
          "passing",
          "failing",
          "missing",
          "unknown"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      },
      "WaitingOn": {
        "enum": [
          "review",
          "dependency",
          "environment",
          "external",
          "decision",
          "unknown"
        ],
        "type": "string"
      }
    },
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "description": "The reply of `blocked`: facts with the status `blocked` and what they wait on.",
    "properties": {
      "as_of": {
        "format": "date-time",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "items": {
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Fact"
        },
        "type": "array"
      },
      "schema": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/SchemaId"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "schema",
      "as_of",
      "items"
    ],
    "title": "BlockedReply",
    "type": "object"
  }
}
